This file exists to satisfy `vibey-gh`'s documentation contract, which expects a Cursor
rules file named `project.mdc` alongside the repository's other agent-facing entry points.
The actual conventions live in one place, not here:

[CLAUDE.md](https://github.com/the-vibey-project/vibey-skills/blob/main/CLAUDE.md) —
what this repository is, how plugins and skills are structured, and the branching,
versioning, and release rules that govern a change.

See also [.cursor/rules/claude.mdc](https://github.com/the-vibey-project/vibey-skills/blob/main/.cursor/rules/claude.mdc),
which points at the same file.
